I do understand about the from output backwards bit. But thats the issue with the dynamic branching - the compiler doesn't know at compile time what path the branch is going to take, does it? Unless the branching is based on some constant value known at compile time. In our case we have:

```
uniform uint some_dynamic_shder_flag;  

...
if (some_dynamic_shder_flag & 0x01)
{
    do this
}
else
{
